1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,000
Is the fire <i>still</i> going?

2
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:01,900
<b>Ana:</b> Just about.

3
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Pass me the marshmallows.

4
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:03,600
Careful, they burn fast!

5
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:04,400
Look at the stars up there.

6
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:05,000
<i>(crackling)</i>
